'''Type of Feat''': [[Class]]

'''Prerequisite''': [[Archmage]] level 1

'''Specifics''': The [[Archmage]] gains the ability to change [[arcane]] spell energy into arcane fire, manifesting it as a bolt of raw magical energy. The bolt is a ranged [[touch attack]] with long range that deals 1d6 points of damage per class level of the [[archmage]] plus 1d6 points of damage per level of the spell used to create the effect. 

'''Use''': Selected. 

==Notes==
*Added in the [[PRC Expansion Pack]].

